  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amoindrissement des risques de protection des communaut&#xE9;s affect&#xE9;es par la crise M23 par le biais d&#x2019;une assistance humanitaire multisectorielle adapt&#xE9;e et garantissant leurs droits</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide over 487,300 people with emergency multi-sectoral assistance. in North and South Kivu. This UNHCR project will assist targeted people with activities in the Protection, Shelter and NFIs, and Camp Coordination and Management sectors. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 487,300 people, including 92,600 women, 311,900 children, and including over 4,800 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
